---
/**
 * privacy.astro — Privacy Policy
 * El footer enlazaba a /privacy desde todas las páginas y la ruta no existía (404).
 * Describe únicamente lo que el sitio hace de verdad hoy:
 *   - /api/contact  → Resend (nombre, email, tipo de consulta, mensaje)
 *   - /api/newsletter → Resend Audiences (email)
 *   - Cloudflare Pages como hosting (logs de acceso)
 * Si se añade un servicio nuevo (analytics, comentarios, embeds), actualizar aquí.
 */
import PageLayout from "@layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { SITE } from "@utils/constants";

const lastUpdated = "August 6, 2026";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="What data carlosposada.dev collects, who processes it, how long it is kept and how to have it deleted."
  schemaType="about"
>
  <div class="pt-32 pb-12 px-6 md:px-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">

    <header class="mb-12" aria-labelledby="privacy-heading">
      <p class="section-label text-tertiary mb-4">Legal</p>
      <h1
        id="privacy-heading"
        class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-tighter mb-6"
        style="font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 3.5rem); line-height: 1.1;"
      >
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-on-surface-variant/60">
        Last updated: {lastUpdated}
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none
                prose-headings:font-headline prose-headings:text-on-surface
                prose-p:text-on-surface-variant prose-li:text-on-surface-variant
                prose-a:text-primary prose-strong:text-on-surface">

      <p>
        This is a personal website. It has no accounts, no advertising and no
        third-party tracking scripts. The only data it receives is what you
        deliberately submit through one of its two forms.
      </p>

      <h2>What is collected</h2>

      <h3>Contact form</h3>
      <p>
        When you submit the form on the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>, the
        following is sent: <strong>your name, your email address, the inquiry type
        you selected and your message</strong>. It is delivered as an email to
        {SITE.email} through <a href="https://resend.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Resend</a>,
        the email provider used by this site. It is not stored in any database here.
      </p>

      <h3>Newsletter</h3>
      <p>
        If you subscribe from a blog post, <strong>only your email address</strong> is
        stored, in a Resend audience list, so new posts can be sent to you. Every email
        includes an unsubscribe link, and you can also ask for removal by writing to
        {SITE.email}.
      </p>

      <h3>Server logs</h3>
      <p>
        This site is hosted on <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare Pages</a>.
        Like any web host, Cloudflare processes technical request data (IP address,
        user agent, requested URL) to serve pages and protect against abuse. That
        processing is governed by Cloudflare's own privacy policy.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This site sets <strong>no cookies</strong> and uses no local storage for
        tracking. Nothing follows you across other websites, so there is no cookie
        banner to dismiss.
      </p>

      <h2>Third parties</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — hosting and edge functions.</li>
        <li><strong>Resend</strong> — delivery of contact emails and the newsletter.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> — typefaces and icons are loaded from Google's CDN, which means your browser makes a request to <code>fonts.googleapis.com</code> and <code>fonts.gstatic.com</code>.</li>
        <li><strong>jsDelivr</strong> — the diagram library used in some blog posts is loaded from <code>cdn.jsdelivr.net</code>.</li>
        <li><strong>Credly</strong> and <strong>Unsplash</strong> — certification badges and illustrative images are served from their CDNs.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        No personal data is sent to any of them; they only see the technical request
        your browser makes to load the asset.
      </p>

      <h2>How long data is kept</h2>
      <p>
        Contact emails are kept in the inbox for as long as the conversation is useful.
        Newsletter addresses are kept until you unsubscribe. There is no other retention.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask what data is held about you, request a copy, or ask for it to be
        deleted at any time by writing to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
        Requests are handled personally — expect a reply within a few days, not an
        automated ticket.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If this site starts using something new — analytics, comments, embedded
        third-party widgets — this page is updated first and the date at the top
        changes with it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
